      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for Want To Move Packers And Movers</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When engaging **move-expert movers** or any professional logistics provider, understanding statutory transit paperwork is essential for a seamless relocation. The foundation of legal transport compliance in India revolves around the **GST e-Way Bill**.</p>
<p>This digital document is mandatory for the movement of goods exceeding a specified value, ensuring transparency and tax compliance during transit. Without a valid e-Way Bill, goods may be detained at check-posts, causing significant delays and potential penalties for both the customer and the moving company.</p>

<p>Beyond tax compliance, the **IBA-approved Lorry Receipt (LR) or Bilty** serves as the primary contractual document. Issued by the transporter, this receipt acknowledges the receipt of goods and details the destination, cargo description, and delivery terms.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">It acts as the title document during transit, proving that the goods were handed over in good condition and specifying the liability of the carrier.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>For clients seeking **packers and move services at colkata** or other major hubs, verifying that the LR is IBA-compliant ensures that the mover is a registered and accountable entity, providing a legal recourse in case of disputes.</span></li></ul>

<p>Financial protection is equally critical, which is why reputable firms offer **comprehensive 100% declared-value IRDAI marine transit insurance**. This policy covers accidental damage, including collisions, theft, or loss due to unforeseen delays and natural calamities.</p>
<p>Unlike basic coverage, this marine transit insurance ensures that if your high-value appliances or fragile items are damaged during the journey, you receive full compensation up to the declared value. This is particularly vital for customers who have invested heavily in home renovation or furniture, as it mitigates the financial risk associated with long-distance moving.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
