    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Learn **how to arrange cartans for home shifting** by understanding that professional movers provide custom-sized, reinforced cartons to prevent breakage, which is a prerequisite for valid insurance claims.</p>
